      "role": "user",
      "content": "so u basically saying that tradition has to be watered down or \"adapted\" to fit into a multicultural setup? feels like u're saying the \"correct\" way to be a citizen is to prioritize pluralism over actually holding onto your own values. is there really a balance there, or is the modern democratic ideal basically just asking people to be less certain about their own identities?",
